# Logging

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and docs/05-logging.md.

- Structured logging only — no string interpolation in log templates
- Never log password, token, card number, or secret key
- Do not set `SourceContext` manually — enrichers handle it
- TraceId: `Activity.Current` + Serilog enricher (OpenTelemetry SDK is backlog)
